# Clicks pick what is drawn under the pointer, nearest first, by the drawing's own order
# (draw-order.md 4.5; Q5-E-03): the Great Altar behind the Parthenon opens its own card, the
# Stoa of Zeus (art over part of its footprint) and the Parsa garrison (a courtyard of walk
# floors) open theirs.
set look landmark:athens.great_altar 1
wait 90
click landmark:athens.great_altar
wait 10
expect info Βωμός
key escape
wait 5
set look landmark:athens.stoa_zeus 1
wait 90
click landmark:athens.stoa_zeus
wait 10
expect info Στοὰ τοῦ Διός
key escape
wait 5
set look landmark:parsa.garrison 1
wait 90
click landmark:parsa.garrison
wait 10
expect info Garrison
quit
